VERSION 1.4.0
-------------

NEW FEATURES

    o Add get_fwrcdr_widths_for_imgt_organism() to obtain the "real"
      FWR/CDR widths for a given IMGT organism, and use it in
      install_IMGT_germline_db() to compute the internal data that
      gets included in the germline db.
      See '?get_fwrcdr_widths_for_imgt_organism' for more information.

    o Thanks to many improvements, install_IMGT_germline_db() now is able
      to compute the internal and auxiliary data for the following IMGT
      organisms:

      * when making an IG germline db (i.e. 'tcr.db=FALSE'):
        - Bos taurus
        - Canis lupus familiaris
        - Ctenopharyngodon idella
        - Equus caballus
        - Felis catus
        - Gallus gallus
        - Gorilla gorilla gorilla
        - Homo sapiens
        - Lemur catta
        - Macaca fascicularis
        - Macaca mulatta
        - Mus musculus
        - Mustela putorius furo
        - Neogale vison
        - Oncorhynchus mykiss
        - Ornithorhynchus anatinus
        - Oryctolagus cuniculus
        - Pongo pygmaeus
        - Rattus norvegicus
        - Salmo salar
        - Sus scrofa
        - Vicugna pacos

      * when making a TR germline db (i.e. 'tcr.db=TRUE'):
        - Bos taurus
        - Camelus dromedarius
        - Canis lupus familiaris
        - Danio rerio
        - Felis catus
        - Gorilla gorilla gorilla
        - Heterocephalus glaber
        - Homo sapiens
        - Macaca fascicularis
        - Macaca mulatta
        - Mus musculus
        - Mustela putorius furo
        - Oryctolagus cuniculus
        - Ovis aries
        - Pan troglodytes
        - Pongo abelii
        - Pongo pygmaeus
        - Sus scrofa

    o use_germline_db() now emits warning if IMGT germline db contains
      incorrect internal data.

    o Add install_OGRDB_germline_db() to create and install an
      IgBLAST-compatible germline database from germline V, D, and J
      gene sequences available at OGRDB: https://ogrdb.airr-community.org/

    o Add combine_germline_dbs() and combine_c_region_dbs() for combining
      two existing germline dbs or C-region dbs, typically (but not
      necessarily) from two different organisms, into a new one.

    o Add percent_mutation() for computing the percent mutation in the
      V, D, J segments of a set of BCR or TCR sequences, at the nucleotide
      or amino acid levels. See '?percent_mutation' for more information.

    o Add net_charge() and extract_region_net_charge().
      See '?net_charge' for the details.

    o Add 'fwrcdr_ends' argument to functions compute_V_gene_delineations()
      and install_custom_germline_db(). See '?compute_V_gene_delineations'
      for more information.

    o install_IMGT_germline_db() now emits a warning if the computed
      "internal data" that it includes in the germline db has disagreements
      with the "internal data" shipped with IgBLAST.

    o Add show_intdata_disagreements() to show disagreements (if any) between
      the computed "internal data" included in a germline db and the "internal
      data" shipped with IgBLAST.

    o compute_auxdata() now handles TCR J alleles.

    o Add low-level utilities validate_and_complete_auxdata_with_ref(),
      solve_cdr3_ends_using_fwr4_aa_comparisons(),
      solve_cdr3_ends_using_fwr4_dna_comparisons(), and
      solve_cdr3_ends_using_fwr4_dna_PWM() that are used internally by
      install_IMGT_germline_db() and install_custom_germline_db() to
      improve the "auxiliary data" obtained with compute_auxdata().

    o Add print_J_alleles() for displaying a set of J allele sequences
      where the sequences are colored and justified w.r.t. their
      CDR3/FWR4 junction.

    o Add print_gapped_V_alleles() for displaying a set of gapped V allele
      sequences where the sequences are colored and split by FWR/CDR regions.

    o Add low-level utility extract_alleles_from_ogrdb_json().

SIGNIFICANT USER-VISIBLE CHANGES

    o Update the list of preinstalled germline dbs.
      The new list is:

        > list_germline_dbs()
         db_name                                       V  D  J intdata auxdata
         _OGRDB.human.IGH+IGK+IGL.202410             342 31 23    TRUE    TRUE
